          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147820,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Media queries help your game UI look good on different screens by applying different styles based on things like width.</p><p>We start creating a media query by using <code>@media</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Pixel Quest HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health and score should fit every screen.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"6\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"media\" class=\"keyword\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>@</code>, followed by <code>media</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147821,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Media queries can target specific screen widths and heights, adjusting styles accordingly.<br /><br /></p><p>We can define a condition for when the viewport is 1200 pixels or less.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Pixel Quest HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Keep the UI readable while you dodge enemies.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(max-width: 1200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>max-width</code>, followed by <code>:</code>, and finally <code>1200px</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147822,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inside the media query, we can define our CSS rules. Add a rule to set the background color for all devices with less than 1,200 px width.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Pixel Quest HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Your HUD adapts as the game screen shrinks.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(max-width: 1200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" body {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  background-color: black;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: lime;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>body</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can also combine multiple conditions. Try to set the background color only when the browser is between 200 and 1,200 px wide.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Dungeon Run\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Shrink the screen and watch the UI adapt.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(min-width: 200px) and (max-width: 1200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" body {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  background-color: black;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: lime;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>min-width</code>, followed by <code>max-width</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You can add as many rules to the <code>@media</code> query as you want.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Space Shooter UI\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health, score, and ammo should stay readable.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"164\" endIndex=\"165\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(max-width: 1200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" body {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  background-color: #111111;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  font-family: Arial;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: #00ffcc;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" p {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: #ffffff;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  font-weight: bold;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>{</code> followed by <code>}</code> and then <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You can also add multiple <code>@media</code> queries.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Boss Fight Overlay\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Different screens need different HUD sizes.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;250&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/r/venn.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(max-width: 200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" body {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  background-color: #222222;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"@media(max-width: 2400px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  font-family: Arial;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: #ffcc00;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>@media</code> followed by <code>(</code> and then <code>max-width: 2400px</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When multiple CSS rules target the same element, the rule declared later in the stylesheet, or with higher specificity, takes precedence.</p><p>Media queries follow the same overriding principles.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"meta\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"charset\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;UTF-8&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"meta\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;viewport&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"content\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Neon Arena\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Neon Arena HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Your UI colors can change by screen size.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" color: #66ffcc;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"@media(max-width: 2400px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: #0066ff;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>h1</code>, followed by <code>h1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why do we use CSS media queries?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To apply different styles for different devices (like desktops, tablets, and phones)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To make the game logic run faster</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To apply different styles for different devices (like desktops, tablets, and phones).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's wrong with this code?</p><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><content><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"media\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" screen and (min-width: \" /><text value=\"600px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"background-color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": black;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": lime;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"font-size\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"200%\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>@media</code> query is missing its closing curly brace</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">We can't add two rules to one <code>@media</code> query</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>@media</code> query is missing its closing curly brace.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147829,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when we add a media query for ensuring styles apply only on screens less than 600px wide?</p><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><content><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"media\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" screen and (max-width: \" /><text value=\"600px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"background-color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": black;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The styles inside the media query apply only when the screen width is less than 600px</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The styles inside the media query apply to screens of all sizes</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The styles inside the media query apply only when the screen width is less than 600px.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How many rules can we add to our <code>@media</code> query?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">As many as we want</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Only one</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">As many as we want.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147831,
